<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Julian" data-copy-zh="Julian">Julian</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Build Julian’s friendship through four conversations, a Commerce reward and the separate private-client roster." data-copy-zh="通过四种谈话提高Julian友谊，领取商业奖励，并了解独立客人名单。">Build Julian’s friendship through four conversations, a Commerce reward and the separate private-client roster.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Read_the_Fine_Print"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Conversations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Julian — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/julian.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Julian — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/julian.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Julian — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Julian offers a platonic friendship through trade, community and family conversations. His personal progression is separate from his possible appearance in the brothel’s client roster.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Where_to_Find_Julian"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Find him daily at Grand Bazaar09:00–14:00, then Noble Quarter14:00–20:00.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Talk is available from Stranger 0; Acknowledged 10 opens market discussion, Known 25 opens community questions, and Acquaintance 50 opens the family topic. Allowances are shared across both locations.</p><p>At Friend 100/Intelligence 30, Read the Fine Print takes 30 min and gives 1 Commerce plus 8 direct affection once. There is no separate personal date or heart-to-heart chain.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Julian</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Grand Bazaar / Noble Quarter; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+2 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Discuss the Market</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Grand Bazaar / Noble Quarter; Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+2 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ask about community</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Grand Bazaar / Noble Quarter; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+2 base affection; 2/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ask about His Family</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Grand Bazaar / Noble Quarter; Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+2 base affection; 2/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Read the Fine Print</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Grand Bazaar / Noble Quarter; Friend (100); Intelligence 30</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 direct affection; Commerce +1; once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>All four repeatable conversation types give 2 base affection, with the individual limits shown below.</p><p>From business Reputation level 11, Julian can appear in the random Receive a Client roster at the Rose &amp; Thorn entrance when operating the brothel branch with Netorare enabled. That system shares one daily booking allowance and does not guarantee Julian; use the Brothel guide for worker eligibility and payment.</p><p>Favorite stats are Intelligence, Commerce, Communication. Learning Accounting improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Switching location does not reset the conversation allowances.</li><li>The Commerce reward checks Intelligence 30 and Friend 100, then completes once.</li><li>A client booking is separate from the friendship menu and requires business Reputation level 11.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Private-client bookings</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Friendship bonuses</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Medieval locations</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Read_the_Fine_Print"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Conversations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Julian 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/julian.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Julian 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/julian.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Julian 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Julian通过贸易、社区与家人话题发展普通友谊，个人进度与青楼中可能出现的客人身份分开。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Where_to_Find_Julian"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>每天09:00–14:00在大集市，14:00–20:00前往贵族区。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>陌生人0即可交谈；已遇见10开放市场话题，已知25开放社区话题，相识50开放家人话题。两处地点共用相应每日额度。</p><p>朋友100、智力30可进行阅读细则，30分钟，一次性增加1商业和8直接好感，没有独立个人约会或交心链。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Julian 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">大集市 / 贵族区；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+2；每天4次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">讨论市场</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">大集市 / 贵族区；已遇见（10好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+2；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">询问社区情况</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">大集市 / 贵族区；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+2；每天2次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">询问他的家人</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">大集市 / 贵族区；相识（50好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+2；每天2次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">阅读细则</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">大集市 / 贵族区；朋友（100好感）；智力30</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+8；商业+1；仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>四种重复谈话均增加2基础好感，各自次数见下表。</p><p>青楼声誉等级11起，经营青楼分支并开启Netorare时，他可能出现在玫瑰与荆棘入口的随机接待客人名单中。该系统共用每天一次预约额度，不保证抽到Julian；员工资格与报酬见青楼指南。</p><p>偏好的属性为智力、商业、沟通。学会会计可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>切换地点不会刷新谈话额度。</li><li>商业奖励检查智力30、朋友100，仅能领取一次。</li><li>客人预约与友谊菜单分开，需要青楼声誉等级11。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">客人预约</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">友谊加成</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">中世纪地点</a></li></ul></section>
